@ ../cmd/root.go:36
Entry point: loads the tour, locates Neovim, builds the model, runs it.
---
@ ../viewer/load.go:22
Reuses Parse/ValidateLocations — same validation as `tour parse`, no second path.
---
@ ../viewer/locate.go:29
Three-step Neovim lookup: process $NVIM, tmux $NVIM, then --nvim.
---
@ ../viewer/model.go:57
New sets up slide 0's state; Init can't mutate the model, only return a Cmd.
---
@ ../viewer/model.go:167
gotoSlide always sets nvimErr definitively — no stale error left over.
---
@ ../viewer/markdown.go:19
Markdown rendered via glamour, re-run whenever the pane resizes.
---
@ ../viewer/vim.go:40
Jump is a Lua script, file/line passed as real args — no escaping needed.
---
@ ../viewer/model.go:112
g-prefix keys (gg, g3⏎) are a small inline state machine, not a type.
---
@ ../viewer/model.go:244
Alt screen: quitting restores the terminal exactly as it was.
---
@ ../viewer/model.go:254
Title bar: current code location + position, replaced by errors when broken.

